    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="&shicang;WangWei_ShanJuQiuMing">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="&shicang;Poetry"/>
        <rdfs:label>山居秋暝</rdfs:label>
        <shicang:title>山居秋暝</shicang:title>
        <shicang:authoredBy rdf:resource="&shicang;WangWei"/>
        <shicang:dynasty>唐</shicang:dynasty>
        <shicang:compositionYear rdf:datatype="&xsd;integer">740</shicang:compositionYear>
        <shicang:hasGenre rdf:resource="&shicang;WuLv"/>
        <shicang:content>空山新雨后，天气晚来秋。明月松间照，清泉石上流。竹喧归浣女，莲动下渔舟</shicang:content>
        <shicang:containsImagery>空山</shicang:containsImagery>
        <shicang:containsImagery>新雨</shicang:containsImagery>
        <shicang:containsImagery>明月</shicang:containsImagery>
        <shicang:containsImagery>青松</shicang:containsImagery>
        <shicang:containsImagery>清泉</shicang:containsImagery>
        <shicang:containsImagery>石</shicang:containsImagery>
        <shicang:containsImagery>竹</shicang:containsImagery>
        <shicang:containsImagery>莲</shicang:containsImagery>
        <shicang:containsImagery>渔舟</shicang:containsImagery>
        <shicang:expressesEmotion>宁静</shicang:expressesEmotion>
        <shicang:expressesEmotion>闲适</shicang:expressesEmotion>
        <shicang:expressesEmotion>恬淡</shicang:expressesEmotion>
        <shicang:hasTheme>山水田园</shicang:hasTheme>
        <shicang:creationBackground>晚年隐居辋川别业时作</shicang:creationBackground>
        <shicang:sourceDataset>王右丞集</shicang:sourceDataset>
        <shicang:compositionPlace>辋川别业（陕西蓝田）</shicang:compositionPlace>
        <shicang:contextType>山居秋暝</shicang:contextType>
        <shicang:compositionSeason>秋</shicang:compositionSeason>
        <shicang:themeColor>#607D8B</shicang:themeColor>
        <shicang:themeAccent>#78909C</shicang:themeAccent>
        <shicang:themeBg>#F5F8F9</shicang:themeBg>
    
        <shicang:rhymeGroup>十一尤</shicang:rhymeGroup>
        <shicang:rhymeScheme>偶句押韵，一韵到底</shicang:rhymeScheme>
        <shicang:rhymeLines>2,4,6,8</shicang:rhymeLines>
        <shicang:studyTheme>恬淡闲适</shicang:studyTheme>
        <shicang:studyDepth>deep</shicang:studyDepth>
        <shicang:studyPage>shicang-poem/WangWei_ShanJuQiuMing.html</shicang:studyPage>
        <shicang:vernacularTranslation>空寂的山中刚下过一场新雨。　傍晚时分，天气带来阵阵秋意。　明月的清辉洒落在松林之间。　清澈的泉水在山石上淙淙流淌。　竹林喧笑，是洗衣的姑娘归来。　莲叶摇动，是渔船顺流而下。　任凭春天的芳菲凋歇吧。　山中的秋色，我自可以留连。</shicang:vernacularTranslation>
        <shicang:englishTranslation>In the empty hills just after the new rain, The evening air brings the feel of autumn. Bright moonlight shines among the pines; Clear spring water flows over the stones. In the bamboos a noise—the washer girls come home; The lotus stirs—a fishing boat goes down. Let the spring's fragrance fade as it will; The prince may well stay on in these hills.</shicang:englishTranslation>
        <shicang:appreciation>此诗为『诗中有画』的典范。颔联『明月松间照，清泉石上流』，上句静、下句动，以光写洁、以声写幽；颈联『竹喧』『莲动』，以喧衬静、以动见净，浣女渔舟皆是人间，却无一点尘嚣。尾联反用《招隐士》之意，把『不可久留』翻成『自可留』，山水之乐与出尘之志，全在其中。</shicang:appreciation>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="&shicang;WangWei_SongYuanErShiAnXi">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="&shicang;Poetry"/>
        <rdfs:label>送元二使安西</rdfs:label>
        <shicang:title>送元二使安西</shicang:title>
        <shicang:authoredBy rdf:resource="&shicang;WangWei"/>
        <shicang:dynasty>唐</shicang:dynasty>
        <shicang:compositionYear rdf:datatype="&xsd;integer">730</shicang:compositionYear>
        <shicang:hasGenre rdf:resource="&shicang;QiJue"/>
        <shicang:content>渭城朝雨浥轻尘，客舍青青柳色新。劝君更尽一杯酒，西出阳关无故人</shicang:content>
        <shicang:alludesTo rdf:resource="&shicang;Allusion_阳关"/>
        <shicang:containsImagery>朝雨</shicang:containsImagery>
        <shicang:containsImagery>轻尘</shicang:containsImagery>
        <shicang:containsImagery>客舍</shicang:containsImagery>
        <shicang:containsImagery>柳</shicang:containsImagery>
        <shicang:containsImagery>酒</shicang:containsImagery>
        <shicang:expressesEmotion>送别</shicang:expressesEmotion>
        <shicang:expressesEmotion>惜别</shicang:expressesEmotion>
        <shicang:hasTheme>送别</shicang:hasTheme>
        <shicang:creationBackground>送别友人元二出使安西都护府</shicang:creationBackground>
        <shicang:sourceDataset>全唐诗</shicang:sourceDataset>
        <shicang:compositionPlace>渭城（陕西咸阳）</shicang:compositionPlace>
        <shicang:contextType>送别</shicang:contextType>
        <shicang:compositionSeason>春</shicang:compositionSeason>
        <shicang:themeColor>#8E44AD</shicang:themeColor>
        <shicang:themeAccent>#E91E63</shicang:themeAccent>
        <shicang:themeBg>#FBF5FC</shicang:themeBg>
    
        <shicang:rhymeGroup>十一真</shicang:rhymeGroup>
        <shicang:rhymeScheme>首句入韵，二、四句押韵（aaaa／aaba 型）</shicang:rhymeScheme>
        <shicang:rhymeLines>1,2,4</shicang:rhymeLines>
        <shicang:studyTheme>旷达超脱</shicang:studyTheme>
        <shicang:studyDepth>deep</shicang:studyDepth>
        <shicang:studyPage>shicang-poem/WangWei_SongYuanErShiAnXi.html</shicang:studyPage>
        <shicang:vernacularTranslation>渭城清晨的一场细雨，润湿了路上的轻尘。　旅舍旁青青的柳色，被雨洗得格外清新。　劝你再喝完这一杯酒吧。　向西出了阳关，就再也见不到老朋友了。</shicang:vernacularTranslation>
        <shicang:englishTranslation>The morning rain of Weicheng wets the light dust; Around the inn the willows look fresh and green. I urge you to drain one more cup of wine: West of Yangguan there is no old friend.</shicang:englishTranslation>
        <shicang:appreciation>送别诗之绝唱，后谱入乐府为《阳关三叠》。前两句写景，『朝雨』『柳色』暗含『留』意（柳谐『留』），一场小雨把离别洗净得清新而清冷。三四句直抒，妙在一个『更』字——已经劝过多次，还要再劝一杯，因为杯中装的是所有说不出口的话，也是此后无可再见的深情。</shicang:appreciation>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="&shicang;WangWei_JiuYueJiuRiYi">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="&shicang;Poetry"/>
        <rdfs:label>九月九日忆山东兄弟</rdfs:label>
        <shicang:title>九月九日忆山东兄弟</shicang:title>
        <shicang:authoredBy rdf:resource="&shicang;WangWei"/>
        <shicang:dynasty>唐</shicang:dynasty>
        <shicang:compositionYear rdf:datatype="&xsd;integer">718</shicang:compositionYear>
        <shicang:hasGenre rdf:resource="&shicang;QiJue"/>
        <shicang:content>独在异乡为异客，每逢佳节倍思亲。遥知兄弟登高处，遍插茱萸少一人</shicang:content>
        <shicang:alludesTo rdf:resource="&shicang;Allusion_重阳节"/>
        <shicang:containsImagery>茱萸</shicang:containsImagery>
        <shicang:containsImagery>登高</shicang:containsImagery>
        <shicang:expressesEmotion>思乡</shicang:expressesEmotion>
        <shicang:expressesEmotion>怀亲</shicang:expressesEmotion>
        <shicang:hasTheme>思乡</shicang:hasTheme>
        <shicang:creationBackground>十七岁时在长安，重阳节思念家乡兄弟</shicang:creationBackground>
        <shicang:sourceDataset>全唐诗</shicang:sourceDataset>
        <shicang:compositionPlace>长安（陕西西安）</shicang:compositionPlace>
        <shicang:contextType>重阳思亲</shicang:contextType>
        <shicang:compositionSeason>秋</shicang:compositionSeason>
        <shicang:themeColor>#8E44AD</shicang:themeColor>
        <shicang:themeAccent>#E91E63</shicang:themeAccent>
        <shicang:themeBg>#FBF5FC</shicang:themeBg>
    
        <shicang:rhymeGroup>十一真</shicang:rhymeGroup>
        <shicang:rhymeScheme>二、四句押韵（abcb 型）</shicang:rhymeScheme>
        <shicang:rhymeLines>2,4</shicang:rhymeLines>
        <shicang:studyTheme>旷达超脱</shicang:studyTheme>
        <shicang:studyDepth>deep</shicang:studyDepth>
        <shicang:studyPage>shicang-poem/WangWei_JiuYueJiuRiYi.html</shicang:studyPage>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="&shicang;MengHaoran_ChunXiao">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="&shicang;Poetry"/>
        <rdfs:label>春晓</rdfs:label>
        <shicang:title>春晓</shicang:title>
        <shicang:authoredBy rdf:resource="&shicang;MengHaoran"/>
        <shicang:dynasty>唐</shicang:dynasty>
        <shicang:compositionYear rdf:datatype="&xsd;integer">730</shicang:compositionYear>
        <shicang:hasGenre rdf:resource="&shicang;WuJue"/>
        <shicang:content>春眠不觉晓，处处闻啼鸟。夜来风雨声，花落知多少</shicang:content>
        <shicang:containsImagery>春眠</shicang:containsImagery>
        <shicang:containsImagery>啼鸟</shicang:containsImagery>
        <shicang:containsImagery>风雨</shicang:containsImagery>
        <shicang:containsImagery>落花</shicang:containsImagery>
        <shicang:expressesEmotion>闲适</shicang:expressesEmotion>
        <shicang:expressesEmotion>惜春</shicang:expressesEmotion>
        <shicang:hasTheme>田园春景</shicang:hasTheme>
        <shicang:creationBackground>隐居鹿门山春日清晨即景</shicang:creationBackground>
        <shicang:sourceDataset>孟浩然集</shicang:sourceDataset>
        <shicang:compositionPlace>鹿门山（湖北襄阳）</shicang:compositionPlace>
        <shicang:contextType>春晨即景</shicang:contextType>
        <shicang:compositionSeason>春</shicang:compositionSeason>
        <shicang:themeColor>#27AE60</shicang:themeColor>
        <shicang:themeAccent>#16A085</shicang:themeAccent>
        <shicang:themeBg>#F4FAF0</shicang:themeBg>
    
        <shicang:rhymeGroup>十七筱</shicang:rhymeGroup>
        <shicang:rhymeScheme>首句入韵，二、四句押韵（aaaa／aaba 型）</shicang:rhymeScheme>
        <shicang:rhymeLines>1,2,4</shicang:rhymeLines>
        <shicang:studyTheme>恬淡闲适</shicang:studyTheme>
        <shicang:studyDepth>deep</shicang:studyDepth>
        <shicang:studyPage>shicang-poem/MengHaoran_ChunXiao.html</shicang:studyPage>
        <shicang:vernacularTranslation>春夜好眠，不知不觉天已破晓。　醒来时只听得处处都是鸟儿的啼鸣。　回想夜里隐隐的风雨之声。　不知那院中的花被打落了多少。</shicang:vernacularTranslation>
        <shicang:englishTranslation>I slept in spring and knew not it was dawn; I hear birds crying all around. Last night there came the sound of wind and rain; How many flowers, I wonder, have fallen down.</shicang:englishTranslation>
        <shicang:appreciation>诗不写春景却处处是春。首句写人之慵懒，次句写听觉之欢快，三句一转由『闻』入『忆』，末句由忆生惜——落花之问，是全诗的魂，惜春之情尽在其中。全篇以声写春、以问写情，含蓄婉转。</shicang:appreciation>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="&shicang;MengHaoran_GuoGuRenZhuang">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="&shicang;Poetry"/>
        <rdfs:label>过故人庄</rdfs:label>
        <shicang:title>过故人庄</shicang:title>
        <shicang:authoredBy rdf:resource="&shicang;MengHaoran"/>
        <shicang:dynasty>唐</shicang:dynasty>
        <shicang:compositionYear rdf:datatype="&xsd;integer">730</shicang:compositionYear>
        <shicang:hasGenre rdf:resource="&shicang;WuLv"/>
        <shicang:content>故人具鸡黍，邀我至田家。绿树村边合，青山郭外斜。开轩面场圃，把酒话桑麻。待到重阳日，还来就菊花</shicang:content>
        <shicang:containsImagery>鸡黍</shicang:containsImagery>
        <shicang:containsImagery>田家</shicang:containsImagery>
        <shicang:containsImagery>绿树</shicang:containsImagery>
        <shicang:containsImagery>青山</shicang:containsImagery>
        <shicang:containsImagery>场圃</shicang:containsImagery>
        <shicang:containsImagery>桑麻</shicang:containsImagery>
        <shicang:containsImagery>菊花</shicang:containsImagery>
        <shicang:expressesEmotion>恬淡</shicang:expressesEmotion>
        <shicang:expressesEmotion>友情</shicang:expressesEmotion>
        <shicang:expressesEmotion>闲适</shicang:expressesEmotion>
        <shicang:hasTheme>田园访友</shicang:hasTheme>
        <shicang:creationBackground>应邀到乡村友人家做客</shicang:creationBackground>
        <shicang:sourceDataset>孟浩然集</shicang:sourceDataset>
        <shicang:compositionPlace>襄阳乡村（湖北）</shicang:compositionPlace>
        <shicang:contextType>田园访友</shicang:contextType>
        <shicang:compositionSeason>秋</shicang:compositionSeason>
        <shicang:themeColor>#27AE60</shicang:themeColor>
        <shicang:themeAccent>#16A085</shicang:themeAccent>
        <shicang:themeBg>#F4FAF0</shicang:themeBg>
    
        <shicang:rhymeGroup>六麻</shicang:rhymeGroup>
        <shicang:rhymeScheme>偶句押韵，一韵到底</shicang:rhymeScheme>
        <shicang:rhymeLines>2,4,6,8</shicang:rhymeLines>
        <shicang:studyTheme>恬淡闲适</shicang:studyTheme>
        <shicang:studyDepth>deep</shicang:studyDepth>
        <shicang:studyPage>shicang-poem/MengHaoran_GuoGuRenZhuang.html</shicang:studyPage>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="&shicang;LiBai_JiangJinJiu">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="&shicang;Poetry"/>
        <rdfs:label>将进酒</rdfs:label>
        <shicang:title>将进酒</shicang:title>
        <shicang:authoredBy rdf:resource="&shicang;LiBai"/>
        <shicang:dynasty>唐</shicang:dynasty>
        <shicang:compositionYear rdf:datatype="&xsd;integer">752</shicang:compositionYear>
        <shicang:hasGenre rdf:resource="&shicang;YueFu"/>
        <shicang:content>君不见黄河之水天上来，奔流到海不复回。天生我材必有用，千金散尽还复来</shicang:content>
        <shicang:alludesTo rdf:resource="&shicang;Allusion_陈王昔"/>
        <shicang:containsImagery>黄河</shicang:containsImagery>
        <shicang:containsImagery>美酒</shicang:containsImagery>
        <shicang:containsImagery>青丝</shicang:containsImagery>
        <shicang:containsImagery>白雪</shicang:containsImagery>
        <shicang:containsImagery>明镜</shicang:containsImagery>
        <shicang:expressesEmotion>豪放</shicang:expressesEmotion>
        <shicang:expressesEmotion>狂放</shicang:expressesEmotion>
        <shicang:expressesEmotion>愤懑</shicang:expressesEmotion>
        <shicang:expressesEmotion>豪迈</shicang:expressesEmotion>
        <shicang:hasTheme>宴饮抒怀</shicang:hasTheme>
        <shicang:creationBackground>被赐金放还后，与友人岑勋、元丹丘嵩山饮酒作</shicang:creationBackground>
        <shicang:sourceDataset>李太白集</shicang:sourceDataset>
        <shicang:compositionPlace>嵩山（河南登封）</shicang:compositionPlace>
        <shicang:contextType>饮酒抒怀</shicang:contextType>
        <shicang:compositionSeason>秋</shicang:compositionSeason>
