        <shicang:expressesEmotion>豪迈</shicang:expressesEmotion>
        <shicang:hasTheme>边塞送别</shicang:hasTheme>
        <shicang:creationBackground>在安西节度使封常清幕中送武判官归京</shicang:creationBackground>
