    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="&shicang;DuFu_ChunWang">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="&shicang;Poetry"/>
        <rdfs:label>春望</rdfs:label>
        <shicang:title>春望</shicang:title>
        <shicang:authoredBy rdf:resource="&shicang;DuFu"/>
        <shicang:dynasty>唐</shicang:dynasty>
        <shicang:compositionYear rdf:datatype="&xsd;integer">757</shicang:compositionYear>
        <shicang:hasGenre rdf:resource="&shicang;WuLv"/>
        <shicang:content>国破山河在，城春草木深。感时花溅泪，恨别鸟惊心。烽火连三月，家书抵万金</shicang:content>
        <shicang:containsImagery>山河</shicang:containsImagery>
        <shicang:containsImagery>草木</shicang:containsImagery>
        <shicang:containsImagery>花</shicang:containsImagery>
        <shicang:containsImagery>鸟</shicang:containsImagery>
        <shicang:containsImagery>烽火</shicang:containsImagery>
        <shicang:containsImagery>家书</shicang:containsImagery>
        <shicang:containsImagery>白头</shicang:containsImagery>
        <shicang:expressesEmotion>忧国</shicang:expressesEmotion>
        <shicang:expressesEmotion>思亲</shicang:expressesEmotion>
        <shicang:expressesEmotion>悲痛</shicang:expressesEmotion>
        <shicang:expressesEmotion>沉郁</shicang:expressesEmotion>
        <shicang:hasTheme>战乱忧国</shicang:hasTheme>
        <shicang:creationBackground>安史之乱中被困长安春日所见</shicang:creationBackground>
        <shicang:sourceDataset>杜工部集</shicang:sourceDataset>
        <shicang:compositionPlace>长安（陕西西安）</shicang:compositionPlace>
        <shicang:contextType>安史乱中被困</shicang:contextType>
        <shicang:compositionSeason>春</shicang:compositionSeason>
        <shicang:themeColor>#7F8C8D</shicang:themeColor>
        <shicang:themeAccent>#2C3E50</shicang:themeAccent>
        <shicang:themeBg>#F5F5F5</shicang:themeBg>
    
        <shicang:rhymeGroup>十二侵</shicang:rhymeGroup>
        <shicang:rhymeScheme>偶句押韵，一韵到底</shicang:rhymeScheme>
        <shicang:rhymeLines>2,4,6,8</shicang:rhymeLines>
        <shicang:studyTheme>慷慨爱国</shicang:studyTheme>
        <shicang:studyDepth>deep</shicang:studyDepth>
        <shicang:studyPage>shicang-poem/DuFu_ChunWang.html</shicang:studyPage>
        <shicang:vernacularTranslation>国都沦陷，山河依旧存在。　长安的春天到了，草木疯长，一片荒芜。　感伤时局，见花开也溅泪。　痛恨离别，闻鸟鸣也惊心。　战火连绵，已经三月不绝。　一封家书，抵得上万两黄金。　满头白发，越搔越短。　简直要连发簪都插不住了。</shicang:vernacularTranslation>
        <shicang:englishTranslation>The kingdom is destroyed; its hills and rivers remain; In the spring of the city, the grass and trees grow deep. Moved by the times, flowers shed tears on my behalf; Bitter at parting, birds startle my heart. The beacon fires have flared for three months without end; A letter from home is worth ten thousand pieces of gold. My white head, scratched, grows shorter still; I am fit only to be without a hair-clasp.</shicang:englishTranslation>
        <shicang:appreciation>开篇『国破』而『山河在』，『城春』而『草木深』，反差之中写尽黍离之悲——明是写景，实是写情。颔联『花溅泪』『鸟惊心』以物之有情反衬人之至痛，为移情之绝唱。颈联由情及事，『烽火』与『家书』对举，乱世之痛可触。尾联以白发搔短、不胜簪作结，忧愁之深，全在形体之衰上见出。</shicang:appreciation>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="&shicang;DuFu_MaoWuWeiQiuFeng">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="&shicang;Poetry"/>
        <rdfs:label>茅屋为秋风所破歌</rdfs:label>
        <shicang:title>茅屋为秋风所破歌</shicang:title>
        <shicang:authoredBy rdf:resource="&shicang;DuFu"/>
        <shicang:dynasty>唐</shicang:dynasty>
