        <shicang:creationBackground>成都草堂被秋风吹破，夜雨屋漏作此</shicang:creationBackground>
        <shicang:sourceDataset>杜工部集</shicang:sourceDataset>
        <shicang:compositionPlace>成都浣花溪草堂</shicang:compositionPlace>
