        <shicang:studyPage>shicang-poem/DuFu_MaoWuWeiQiuFeng.html</shicang:studyPage>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="&shicang;DuFu_DengGao">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="&shicang;Poetry"/>
        <rdfs:label>登高</rdfs:label>
        <shicang:title>登高</shicang:title>
        <shicang:authoredBy rdf:resource="&shicang;DuFu"/>
        <shicang:dynasty>唐</shicang:dynasty>
        <shicang:compositionYear rdf:datatype="&xsd;integer">767</shicang:compositionYear>
        <shicang:hasGenre rdf:resource="&shicang;QiLv"/>
        <shicang:content>风急天高猿啸哀，渚清沙白鸟飞回。无边落木萧萧下，不尽长江滚滚来。万里悲秋常作客，百年多病独登台</shicang:content>
        <shicang:containsImagery>风</shicang:containsImagery>
        <shicang:containsImagery>天</shicang:containsImagery>
        <shicang:containsImagery>猿</shicang:containsImagery>
        <shicang:containsImagery>渚</shicang:containsImagery>
        <shicang:containsImagery>沙</shicang:containsImagery>
        <shicang:containsImagery>鸟</shicang:containsImagery>
        <shicang:containsImagery>落木</shicang:containsImagery>
        <shicang:containsImagery>长江</shicang:containsImagery>
        <shicang:containsImagery>秋</shicang:containsImagery>
        <shicang:containsImagery>台</shicang:containsImagery>
        <shicang:expressesEmotion>沉郁</shicang:expressesEmotion>
        <shicang:expressesEmotion>悲秋</shicang:expressesEmotion>
        <shicang:expressesEmotion>老病</shicang:expressesEmotion>
        <shicang:expressesEmotion>孤独</shicang:expressesEmotion>
        <shicang:hasTheme>登高悲秋</shicang:hasTheme>
        <shicang:creationBackground>夔州重阳节登高，寓居巴蜀多病</shicang:creationBackground>
        <shicang:sourceDataset>杜工部集，古今七言律第一</shicang:sourceDataset>
        <shicang:compositionPlace>夔州（重庆奉节）</shicang:compositionPlace>
        <shicang:contextType>重阳登高</shicang:contextType>
        <shicang:compositionSeason>秋</shicang:compositionSeason>
        <shicang:themeColor>#7F8C8D</shicang:themeColor>
        <shicang:themeAccent>#2C3E50</shicang:themeAccent>
        <shicang:themeBg>#F5F5F5</shicang:themeBg>
    
        <shicang:rhymeGroup>十灰</shicang:rhymeGroup>
        <shicang:rhymeScheme>首句入韵，逐偶句押韵，一韵到底</shicang:rhymeScheme>
        <shicang:rhymeLines>1,2,4,6,8</shicang:rhymeLines>
        <shicang:studyTheme>悲慨沉郁</shicang:studyTheme>
        <shicang:studyDepth>deep</shicang:studyDepth>
        <shicang:studyPage>shicang-poem/DuFu_DengGao.html</shicang:studyPage>
        <shicang:vernacularTranslation>秋风劲急，天宇高远，猿声凄厉哀转。　水清沙白的洲渚上，鸟儿在风中盘旋。　无边无际的落叶萧萧地飘落。　奔流不尽的江水滚滚而来。　悲叹秋日，万里漂泊常年为客。　一生多病，今日独自登临高台。　历尽艰难，深恨这满头如霜的白发。　穷愁潦倒，偏偏新近又停下了浊酒杯。</shicang:vernacularTranslation>
        <shicang:englishTranslation>The wind is sharp, the sky is high, the apes howl in grief; Over the clear isle and white sand the birds wheel back. The boundless falling leaves rustle down without end; The endless Long River rolls on and on. Ten thousand li from home, I sorrow in autumn, ever a stranger; A hundred years of many ills, alone I climb the height. Through hardship and bitter regret my temples frost with white; Poor and ill, I have newly given up my cup of cloudy wine.</shicang:englishTranslation>
        <shicang:appreciation>被誉为『古今七律第一』。前四句写景，以『急』『高』『哀』『清』『白』『无边』『不尽』等字层层催逼，苍茫阔大中透出肃杀；后四句抒情，『万里』对『百年』，『悲秋』对『多病』，『常作客』对『独登台』，八重愁绪如浪叠来。结句以因病戒酒作结，欲悲无酒，沉郁至极。八句皆对仗，却无板滞之迹。</shicang:appreciation>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="&shicang;DuFu_SanLiSanBie">
