    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="&shicang;SuShi_ShuiDiaoGeTou">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="&shicang;Poetry"/>
        <rdfs:label>水调歌头·明月几时有</rdfs:label>
        <shicang:title>水调歌头·明月几时有</shicang:title>
        <shicang:authoredBy rdf:resource="&shicang;SuShi"/>
        <shicang:dynasty>北宋</shicang:dynasty>
        <shicang:compositionYear rdf:datatype="&xsd;integer">1076</shicang:compositionYear>
        <shicang:hasGenre rdf:resource="&shicang;Ci"/>
        <shicang:content>明月几时有？把酒问青天。人有悲欢离合，月有阴晴圆缺，此事古难全。但愿人长久，千里共婵娟</shicang:content>
        <shicang:alludesTo rdf:resource="&shicang;Allusion_嫦娥婵"/>
        <shicang:containsImagery>明月</shicang:containsImagery>
        <shicang:containsImagery>青天</shicang:containsImagery>
        <shicang:containsImagery>宫阙</shicang:containsImagery>
        <shicang:containsImagery>琼楼玉宇</shicang:containsImagery>
        <shicang:containsImagery>婵娟</shicang:containsImagery>
        <shicang:expressesEmotion>思亲</shicang:expressesEmotion>
        <shicang:expressesEmotion>旷达</shicang:expressesEmotion>
        <shicang:expressesEmotion>中秋</shicang:expressesEmotion>
        <shicang:expressesEmotion>祝福</shicang:expressesEmotion>
        <shicang:hasTheme>中秋怀人</shicang:hasTheme>
        <shicang:creationBackground>密州知州任上中秋，怀念弟弟苏辙七年未见，醉后作</shicang:creationBackground>
        <shicang:sourceDataset>东坡乐府，中秋词千古第一</shicang:sourceDataset>
        <shicang:compositionPlace>密州（山东诸城）</shicang:compositionPlace>
        <shicang:contextType>中秋怀弟</shicang:contextType>
        <shicang:compositionSeason>秋</shicang:compositionSeason>
        <shicang:themeColor>#2980B9</shicang:themeColor>
        <shicang:themeAccent>#3498DB</shicang:themeAccent>
        <shicang:themeBg>#F0F7FC</shicang:themeBg>
    
        <shicang:rhymeGroup>一先</shicang:rhymeGroup>
        <shicang:rhymeScheme>押韵句：第1句、第2句、第3句、第4句、第5句、第6句、第7句、第8句</shicang:rhymeScheme>
        <shicang:rhymeLines>1,2,3,4,5,6,7,8</shicang:rhymeLines>
        <shicang:studyTheme>旷达超脱</shicang:studyTheme>
        <shicang:studyDepth>deep</shicang:studyDepth>
        <shicang:studyPage>shicang-poem/SuShi_ShuiDiaoGeTou.html</shicang:studyPage>
        <shicang:vernacularTranslation>明月是什么时候才有的呢？我端起酒杯询问青天。　不知道天上的宫阙，今夜是何年何月。　我想驾着长风回到天上去，又怕那琼楼玉宇，太高太冷经受不住。　起身舞蹈，玩赏着清朗的影子，哪里比得上在人间呢。　月光转过朱红的楼阁，低低照进雕花的窗户，照着睡不着的人。　明月该不是有什么怨恨吧，为何总在人们离别时才圆呢？　人有悲欢离合，月有阴晴圆缺，此事自古难以两全。　只愿人能够长久平安，即使相隔千里，也能共享这一轮明月。</shicang:vernacularTranslation>
        <shicang:englishTranslation>When did the bright moon first appear? Wine cup in hand, I ask the blue sky. I do not know in the palace of heaven what year tonight it is. I would ride the wind and go back, yet fear the jade towers and courts, too high to bear the cold. Rising to dance with my clear shadow, how could it compare with the world of men? The moon turns round the vermilion tower, dips low through the carved windows, shining on the sleepless. It should hold no grudge—why then is it always full when people part? Men have sorrow and joy, parting and meeting; the moon waxes and wanes: nothing has ever been perfect. Would that we might live long, sharing the same fair moon though a thousand li apart.</shicang:englishTranslation>
        <shicang:appreciation>此词以问月起，以共月起收，一『问』一『愿』，把神话、哲思与骨肉之情熔于一炉。上片由『欲乘风归去』到『何似在人间』，是出世与入世的徘徊，最终落定于人间；下片由月之照人写到人之怨月，复以『此事古难全』自我宽解，最后翻出『但愿人长久，千里共婵娟』——从个人的离愁中超脱出来，化作对天下人的祝愿。旷达而不冷漠，深情而不粘滞。</shicang:appreciation>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="&shicang;SuShi_NianNuJiao">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="&shicang;Poetry"/>
        <rdfs:label>念奴娇·赤壁怀古</rdfs:label>
        <shicang:title>念奴娇·赤壁怀古</shicang:title>
        <shicang:authoredBy rdf:resource="&shicang;SuShi"/>
        <shicang:dynasty>北宋</shicang:dynasty>
        <shicang:compositionYear rdf:datatype="&xsd;integer">1082</shicang:compositionYear>
        <shicang:hasGenre rdf:resource="&shicang;Ci"/>
        <shicang:content>大江东去，浪淘尽千古风流人物。故垒西边，人道是三国周郎赤壁。乱石穿空，惊涛拍岸，卷起千堆雪。人生如梦，一尊还酹江月</shicang:content>
        <shicang:alludesTo rdf:resource="&shicang;Allusion_周瑜赤"/>
        <shicang:containsImagery>大江</shicang:containsImagery>
        <shicang:containsImagery>浪</shicang:containsImagery>
        <shicang:containsImagery>乱石</shicang:containsImagery>
        <shicang:containsImagery>惊涛</shicang:containsImagery>
        <shicang:containsImagery>雪</shicang:containsImagery>
        <shicang:containsImagery>羽扇纶巾</shicang:containsImagery>
        <shicang:containsImagery>樯橹</shicang:containsImagery>
        <shicang:containsImagery>江月</shicang:containsImagery>
        <shicang:expressesEmotion>豪放</shicang:expressesEmotion>
        <shicang:expressesEmotion>怀古</shicang:expressesEmotion>
        <shicang:expressesEmotion>感慨</shicang:expressesEmotion>
        <shicang:expressesEmotion>旷达</shicang:expressesEmotion>
        <shicang:hasTheme>怀古咏史</shicang:hasTheme>
        <shicang:creationBackground>贬黄州团练副使，游黄冈赤壁作，豪放词压卷</shicang:creationBackground>
        <shicang:sourceDataset>东坡乐府</shicang:sourceDataset>
        <shicang:compositionPlace>黄州赤壁（湖北黄冈）</shicang:compositionPlace>
        <shicang:contextType>贬谪怀古</shicang:contextType>
        <shicang:compositionSeason>秋</shicang:compositionSeason>
        <shicang:themeColor>#C0392B</shicang:themeColor>
        <shicang:themeAccent>#E67E22</shicang:themeAccent>
        <shicang:themeBg>#FDF6E3</shicang:themeBg>
    
        <shicang:rhymeGroup>歌</shicang:rhymeGroup>
        <shicang:rhymeScheme>押韵句：第1句、第2句、第3句、第4句、第5句、第6句、第7句、第8句</shicang:rhymeScheme>
        <shicang:rhymeLines>1,2,3,4,5,6,7,8</shicang:rhymeLines>
        <shicang:studyTheme>怀古沧桑</shicang:studyTheme>
        <shicang:studyDepth>deep</shicang:studyDepth>
        <shicang:studyPage>shicang-poem/SuShi_NianNuJiao.html</shicang:studyPage>
        <shicang:vernacularTranslation>大江浩浩东流，浪涛淘尽了千古以来的英雄人物。　旧营垒的西边，人们说，那就是三国周瑜鏖战的赤壁。　乱石嶙峋，直插云天；惊涛拍击江岸，卷起千堆白雪般的浪花。　江山美如图画，一时之间涌现了多少豪杰。　遥想周瑜当年，小乔刚刚嫁给他，他英姿勃发。　手执羽扇，头戴纶巾，谈笑之间，曹军的战船便灰飞烟灭。　神游故国，多情的人应该笑我，早早生出了满头花白。　人生如梦，且把这杯酒洒向江中的明月。</shicang:vernacularTranslation>
        <shicang:englishTranslation>The great river flows east; its waves wash away all the gallant heroes of a thousand years. West of the old ramparts, people say, is the Red Cliff where Zhou Yu of the Three Kingdoms fought. Jagged rocks pierce the sky; angry waves beat the shore, rolling up a thousand heaps of snow. Rivers and hills are like a painting; for a time how many heroes were there? I think back to Gongjin in his prime, when Xiaoqiao had just married him, splendid and heroic. With feather fan and silken cap, amid talk and laughter, the enemy's masts and oars turned to flying ash. In spirit I roam the old kingdom; men would laugh at my sentiment, my hair turning grey so soon. Life is like a dream—let me pour a cup of wine to the moon on the river.</shicang:englishTranslation>
        <shicang:appreciation>开篇『大江东去』四字如巨浪奔涌，把时间、空间与人事一并卷走，气象之宏大，千古罕匹。上片写景，『乱石穿空』『惊涛拍岸』『卷起千堆雪』，声、色、势俱足；下片写人，以『小乔初嫁』点其年少得意，以『羽扇纶巾』『谈笑间』写其从容破敌，周郎之英发与词人之迟暮相映。结句『人生如梦，一尊还酹江月』，把怀古的苍凉升华成对宇宙人生的旷达之悟。</shicang:appreciation>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="&shicang;SuShi_TiXiLinBi">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="&shicang;Poetry"/>
        <rdfs:label>题西林壁</rdfs:label>
        <shicang:title>题西林壁</shicang:title>
